# 3️⃣ Basic Stack Operations

### Push

Insert an element.

```
Push(50)
```

```
Before

30

20

10

↓

After

50

30

20

10
```

---

### Pop

Remove the top element.

```
Pop()
```

```
Before

40

30

20

↓

After

30

20
```

---

### Peek / Top

Returns the top element without removing it.

Example

```
Top = 40
```

---

### isEmpty()

Checks whether the stack contains any elements.

Output

```
True

or

False
```

---

### Size()

Returns the total number of elements.

Example

```
Stack

10

20

30

Size = 3
```

