# 4️⃣ Stack Representation

A Stack can be represented in two ways.

---

### Using Array

```
TOP

↓

40

30

20

10
```

Advantages

✅ Fast access

✅ Easy implementation

---

### Using Linked List

```
TOP

↓

40

↓

30

↓

20

↓

10
```

Advantages

✅ Dynamic size

✅ No overflow due to fixed array size

