# 8️⃣ Overflow & Underflow

## Overflow

Occurs when trying to insert into a full stack.

```
Stack Full

Cannot Push
```

---

## Underflow

Occurs when trying to remove from an empty stack.

```
Stack Empty

Cannot Pop
```

